WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.200
Han Zhuo was once a trusted man at Hou Yi's side.

00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:09.014
Capable and clever, he slowly rose high in Hou Yi's favor.

00:00:09.364 --> 00:00:15.532
But Han Zhuo was not satisfied — he wanted power for himself.

00:00:15.882 --> 00:00:19.866
In secret he gathered his followers and waited for the perfect moment.

00:00:20.216 --> 00:00:24.512
While Hou Yi's guard was down, he launched a coup.

00:00:24.862 --> 00:00:29.902
Han Zhuo seized power and became the new ruler.

00:00:30.252 --> 00:00:34.860
Han Zhuo and his sons kept attacking the Xia royal house.

00:00:35.210 --> 00:00:38.762
The royal family's strength faded, and its members hid in many places.

00:00:39.112 --> 00:00:45.760
Amid these hardships, Shao Kang of the Xia royal house slowly grew up.

00:00:46.110 --> 00:00:49.662
He studied and worked hard, and won the support of many people.

00:00:50.012 --> 00:00:53.348
Many years later, Shao Kang gathered his forces once more.

00:00:53.698 --> 00:00:58.522
He restored the rule of Xia and brought new hope.

